  "description": "Beautiful, Modern, Fully Renovated 1-Bed Apartment – Clifden Court, Dublin 7 (Liffey Views)\n\nProperty Overview:\n\nA beautiful, completely refurbished 2nd-floor one-bedroom apartment situated in the well-maintained Clifden Court development on the banks of the River Liffey. \nFinished to a high standard throughout, this quiet, energy-efficient home offers comfortable city living in a central location.\n\nKey Features:\nComplete High-Standard Renovation: Brand-new interior featuring new flooring, lighting, modern furnishings, blackout curtains with white sheer curtain, new electric heaters, and quality double glazing for a quiet indoor atmosphere.\n•\tModern Kitchen: Fully fitted with brand-new appliances, including an integrated full-size fridge-freezer, oven, and hob.\n•\tHallway Laundry & Boiler Closet: Dedicated hallway closet housing a new washer-dryer (keeping laundry out of the kitchen), and high-efficiency electric heating boiler.\n•\tDouble Bedroom: Bright and peaceful room with a new double bed and extensive floor-to-ceiling built-in wardrobes.\n•\tContemporary Bathroom: Fully tiled floor-to-ceiling in marble-effect porcelain, featuring a glass corner shower, modern vanity unit, and heated towel rail.\n•\tBuilding Amenities & Inclusions: Second-floor apartment with elevator access, landscaped internal courtyard gardens, and refuse/bins included in rent.\n•\tPrime Central Location: Situated in Dublin 7 directly along the Liffey with excellent public transport links right on your doorstep (Luas line and major bus routes). Within short walking distance of Smithfield, Stoneybatter, Heuston Station, and the City Centre.\n\nRental Terms & Application:\n\n•\tLease: Minimum 6-month lease.\n•\tAvailability: Immediate.\n•\tPolicies: Strictly Non-Smoking. No Pets.\n•\tParking: No car parking space included.\n\nHow to Apply:\nIf interested, please respond via email with a brief introduction about yourself (current occupation, target move-in date, and confirmation of available references).",
